From 05f7e89ab9731565d8a62e3b5d1ec206485eeb0b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: odin-port <odin@port.local>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:08:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] arm64: dts: qcom: add device tree for Smartisan ODIN (U2
 Pro)

Add initial support for the Smartisan ODIN (U2 Pro), an MSM8953
(Snapdragon 625) smartphone:

- eMMC and microSD storage
- USB Type-C with dual-role support via FUSB301 CC controller,
  including OTG VBUS from the SMBCHG boost converter for host mode
- Display: MDSS/DSI0/14nm PHY with WLED backlight and LAB/IBB
  bias regulators. The panel compatible is a placeholder that is
  filled in by lk2nd based on the panel detected at boot; drivers
  for all five stock panel variants (R69006 cmd/video, FT8716,
  Sharp FT8716, NT36672) are available.
- Volume keys, console UART, ramoops

背光与 GPU 两处按实机结果修正：
- &pmi8950_wled 去掉 qcom,external-pfet / qcom,cabc；qcom,ovp-millivolt
  取值见正文注释（2026-09-01 换基线后定为 29500，此前一段时间写的是 29600，
  两张合法表的取值不同，写错会 probe -EINVAL、整条显示链路断掉）
- 新增 &gpu { status = "okay"; }（msm8953.dtsi 里 gpu 默认 disabled，
  不启用会 "msm_mdp: no GPU device was found"）

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
